<section class="extras-hero" aria-labelledby="extras-title">
  <div class="container extras-hero__inner">
    <p class="logo-band__label" data-i18n="hero.kicker">Outside engineering</p>
    <h1 class ="extras-title" id="extras-title" data-i18n="hero.title">Extras</h1>
    <p class="extras-hero__summary" data-i18n="hero.summary">
      A small glimpse at the things that keep me curious when I step away from CAD,
      theory and hardware.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="extras-intro" aria-label="Personal interests">
  <div class="container extras-intro__grid">
    <figure class="extras-intro__media">
      {% img "assets/images/free-time/fpv-drone-landscape.jpg", "FPV drone and open landscape" %}
    </figure>

    <div class="extras-intro__copy">
      <p class="logo-band__label" data-i18n="intro.kicker">Free time</p>
      <h2 data-i18n="intro.title">Motion, places and quiet resets.</h2>
      <p data-i18n="intro.text.0">
        Outside of engineering, I am drawn to activities that mix attention, movement, and a bit
 of controlled chaos: FPV flying, riding, snowboarding, travel, and photography.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="intro.text.1">
        They are different from engineering work, but they support the same habit: noticing details,
        learning by doing and staying comfortable when things are not perfectly predictable.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="extras-moments" aria-labelledby="moments-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="extras-moments__head">
      <p class="logo-band__label" data-i18n="moments.kicker">Hobbies</p>
      <h2 id="moments-title" data-i18n="moments.title">A Few Things I Come Back To</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="extras-moments__grid">
      <article class="extras-moment extras-moment--wide">
        <figure class="extras-moment__media">
          {% img "assets/images/free-time/snowboarding-mountains.jpg", "Snowboarding in the mountains" %}
        </figure>
        <div class="extras-moment__copy">
          <h3 data-i18n="moments.0.title">Snowboarding</h3>
          <p data-i18n="moments.0.text">As a professional snowboard instructor, snowboarding is one of the cleanest ways I know to reset: freedom, fast feedback, and simple rules.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="extras-moment">
        <figure class="extras-moment__media">
          {% img "assets/images/free-time/motorcycle-road.jpg", "Motorcycle on a road" %}
        </figure>
        <div class="extras-moment__copy">
          <h3 data-i18n="moments.1.title">Motorbike</h3>
          <p data-i18n="moments.1.text">Good roads, good weather, and airflow over my face. The right balance means everything.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="extras-moment">
        <figure class="extras-moment__media">
          {% img "assets/images/free-time/campfire-night-2.jpg", "Campfire at night" %}
        </figure>
        <div class="extras-moment__copy">
          <h3 data-i18n="moments.2.title">Firesport</h3>
          <p data-i18n="moments.2.text">This competitive sport combines team spirit and individual performance.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="extras-moment extras-moment--wide">
        <figure class="extras-moment__media">
          {% img "assets/images/free-time/nasa-visit.jpeg", "NASA visit" %}
        </figure>
        <div class="extras-moment__copy">
          <h3 data-i18n="moments.3.title">Places that make me look up</h3>
          <p data-i18n="moments.3.text">Travel and aerospace history keep the larger picture close: engineering is still about wonder.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="extras-closing">
  <div class="container extras-closing__inner">
    <p data-i18n="closing.text">
      Not everything has to become a project. Some things are just there to keep the mind sharp,
 The body is moving, and the week is a little more alive.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
